"""Schema migrations for Family Mission.

**Runtime source of truth:** `app.core.migrations.run_light_migrations()` — called on every
backend startup from `main.py`. It applies idempotent DDL + one-time data backfills.

**Alembic:** mirrors major schema revisions for manual/CI use on fresh databases:
  cd backend && alembic upgrade head

When adding schema changes:
1. Add idempotent SQL to `run_light_migrations()` (required — this runs in production).
2. Add a matching Alembic revision here (optional but keeps `alembic upgrade head` in sync).

Do not rely on Alembic alone at runtime; it is not invoked from `main.py`.
"""
